Root cause:
The bug was caused by the incorrect handling of the variable `i` in the `FindLength` function. The variable was declared outside of the loop, which led to it not being incremented properly during the iterations of the while loops. This made the checks on `i` ineffective, potentially causing the function to behave incorrectly when determining the length of the stream.

